### Description

@diegosouzapw. This issue is stopping my primary use-case of using omniroute. Please take a look.

For any model chosen Antigravity IDE, MITM intercepts and processes it as gemini-3.1-flash-lite.

Details in steps in reproduce section.

### Steps to Reproduce

1. Open Antigravity IDE
2. Choose gemini 3.6 Flash medium model
3. Execute any prompt
4. See the logs. You will see first gemini-3.6-flash-medium, then later it uses gemini-3.1-flash-lite. 
5. Logs are pasted in logs section

### Expected Behavior

Chosen model in Antigravity IDE should be used

### Actual Behavior

Always gemini-3.1-flash-lite  is used.

